sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Super Admin / Registrar
    participant UI as Command Gateway (/admin)
    participant Auth as Admin Auth & MFA Engine
    participant API as Express Admin Router
    participant DB as MongoDB Atlas

    Admin->>UI: Enter Admin Email / ID (admin@coopnex.local) & Password
    UI->>Auth: POST /api/admin/auth/login
    Auth->>DB: Admin.findOne({ email, role: "SUPER_ADMIN" })
    Auth->>Auth: Verify Bcrypt Hash & Check Account Lockout Policy
    Auth-->>UI: Password validated, Issue 5m MFA Challenge Token
    UI-->>Admin: Prompt TOTP 2-Factor Authentication Code
    Admin->>UI: Enter 6-Digit MFA Authenticator Code (e.g. 892104)
    UI->>Auth: POST /api/admin/auth/verify-mfa
    Auth-->>UI: 200 OK: Issue 12h Super Admin JWT Token
    UI->>API: GET /api/admin/intelligence
    API->>DB: Aggregate total workers, active jobs, earnings & welfare corpus
    API-->>UI: KPI Metrics, Demand Heatmaps & Real-time Surge Alerts
    Admin->>UI: Open KYC Verification Queue (e.g. Worker Level 4 review)
    UI->>API: GET /api/admin/kyc-submissions
    API->>DB: Worker.find({ "kycDocuments.verificationStatus": "PENDING" })
    Admin->>UI: Inspect Aadhaar Verhoeff & Police Clearance Certificate
    Admin->>UI: Click "Approve & Promote to Level 4"
    UI->>API: POST /api/admin/kyc/:workerId/review (action: "APPROVE_PROMOTE")
    API->>DB: Worker.updateOne(verificationStatus: "VERIFIED", verificationLevel: 4)
    API->>DB: AdminAuditLog.create(action: "APPROVE_KYC_PROMOTION", adminId)
    Admin->>UI: Review Inter-Cooperative Workforce Exchange Proposals
    UI->>API: POST /api/admin/workforce-exchanges/:id/approve
    API->>DB: WorkforceExchange.updateOne(status: "APPROVED")
    API-->>UI: Inter-society mutual aid transfer authorized

